        "attempt": 1,
        "status": "OK",
        "duration_seconds": 39.381,
        "asr_text": "A trip can feel slower before it becomes longer. That is the tension in Japan's youth travel picture as of September 2026. Young people, especially young men, increasingly want to travel at their own pace, but the available numbers on actual stays do not yet show a clear move to longer trips. For these travelers, a good trip is not always about seeing as many famous places as possible. It can mean having room in the day and choosing what matters to them. Several surveys point to the same wish: more control and less pressure in the schedule.",
