        "status": "OK",
        "duration_seconds": 40.251,
        "asr_text": "But a wish is not the same as a travel pattern. Signs of a slower style are easier to see in what people say they want than in how long trips currently last. So this is not a finished change from sightseeing to slow travel. It is a gap between a new preference and current travel habits. The pattern is not the same for all young people. Among women aged 29 and under, visiting famous tourist places remains popular, at about 45 percent. The strongest signal is among young men, while the overall picture is mixed.",
